# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 01fd76ebbb7c1e56944d9b6dd12a30dcc6d6e4cd482d35a9f54e334275e5bd6f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server e136e4f39612f5919e3be2f48c0f4a6a1b85162c64b576228f5a7ad19d605485
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm fad0ccdc894548d0f9c7002c11af319b765a2ed8b8f4bac7b5e43ea71e3587fe
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 2bc15a887562610a12492ccb649382731ff4b0f1281832c3594efb3dfd32f057
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 3118556d10052d9f3b81ea654b6be628b567cb1594285fd3a5eda348fdba5279
